==Estonian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|et}} {{term/t|fiu-fin-pro|*neljä}}, from the same Finno-Ugric root {{term/t|fiu-pro|*ńeljä}} as Finnish [[neljä]] and Hungarian [[négy]]

